  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 414.03 Permit Applications.\n\n(a) A completed permit application shall be mailed or hand-delivered to the department of safety, marine patrol bureau, 31 Dock Road, Gilford, New Hampshire 03249-7627.\n\n(b) An incomplete permit application shall be returned to the applicant, along with a letter of explanation. The applicant may resubmit the permit application once completed.\n\nSource. #5448, eff 8-24-92; amd by #5862, eff 7-1-94; ss by #6005, eff 3-24-95, EXPIRED: 3-24-03\n\nNew. #7904, INTERIM, eff 6-24-03, EXPIRED: 12-21-03\n\nNew. #8107, EMERGENCY, eff 6-22-04, EXPIRES: 12-19-04; ss by #8172, eff 9-21-04; (See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading) renumbered by #9544 (formerly Saf-C 413.03); ss by #10293, eff 3-20-13",
